{"answer": 2, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 부정적분을 구한다</div>\n    $$\n    \\int_0^{2}\\left(6x^2-2x+1\\right)dx=\\Big[2x^3-x^2+x\\Big]_0^{2}.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> 대입한다</div>\n    $$\n    16-4+2=14.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;②</div>\n"}